{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55840","headline":"九日溪偶成 · 钱熙","name":"九日溪偶成","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"渔家深处住。\n鸥鹭泊柴扉。\n雨过山（《清源文献》作「莎」）迷径，潮来风满衣。\n岸幽分远景，波冷漾清（《清源文献》作「晴」）晖。\n却忆曾游赏，严陵有旧矶。\n（见同书卷七、《宋诗纪事》卷四引《清源文献》）（按：《舆地纪胜》、《全芳备祖》、《皇朝事实类苑》引《杨文公谈苑》尚存熙诗多首，似皆入宋後作，兹不录。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱熙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55840.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55840","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}